      "message": "fix: MSRV of 1.84\n\nIt would seem like the crate `base64ct` bumped their MSRV to 1.85 and added the\nnew edition:\n\n- https://github.com/RustCrypto/formats/commit/ea10f3b1337faf08f14ba3e25edde10cad2dd07e\n- https://github.com/RustCrypto/formats/pull/1859/files\n\nThis blocks us from publishing using `rust-version = 1.82`. We bump to `1.84` to\nallow us to publish the crate.",
