      "sha": "b41229ca07af04e310b70fba24ec99f1cafc3913",
      "message": "build(Cargo.toml): set minimum supported Rust version\n\nSets the MSRV for the crate. The `rust-toolchain.toml` file is dropped since\nthis is too retrictive when choosing choosing a toolchain for developing the\ncrate – uses exact semantics.\n\nIt is necessary to change the `flake.nix` to read this version from the\n`Cargo.toml` so that it can select the rust toolchain to use via `rust-overlay`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Lars Wirzenius <redacted@example.invalid>\nCo-authored-by: Fintan Halpenny <redacted@example.invalid>",
